{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7f3a2c1-4d5e-4a8b-9c1f-messmate00011",
    "name": "MessMate · 11 · Security & RBAC checks",
    "description": "**Negative test — ekhane request fail hoya-i \"pass\".** Prati request-e `401`/`403`/`404` asha uchit.\n\nEi folder ta **nijei role bodlay** (`↪ Login as ...` request gulo), tai puro folder ekbare run kora jay. Shesh-e abar Owner-e fire ashe.\n\n**Ekhane ja proman hoy:**\n- Token chhara dhoka jay na\n- Cook taka-poisa dekhte pare na\n- Member onner data ba admin kaj korte pare na\n- Onno mess-er data faash hoy na (404, 403 na)\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Ei collection ta alada (standalone)\n\nAlada collection-er moddhe **collection variable share hoy na**. Tai sob id\n**environment**-e rakha hoy — sob collection ekei environment dekhe.\n\n**Chalanor age:**\n\n1. Upore daan pashe environment dropdown-e **\"MessMate — Local\"** select kora ache kina dekho\n2. **`01 · Auth`** collection theke ei tinta chalao (ekbar chalalei jothesto):\n   - `Login — Owner` → token\n   - `Me` → messId, membershipId\n   - `Setup — load current period` → periodId\n\nErpor ei collection-er request gulo kaj korbe.\n\n**Environment select na thakle** `{{messId}}` khali theke jabe ar `400` ashbe.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Mess-er timezone (Asia/Dhaka, UTC+6) dhore date variable set kora hoy,",
          "// jate cutoff test gulo tomar computer-er timezone-e bhul na hoy.",
          "const nowDhaka = new Date(Date.now() + 6 * 3600 * 1000);",
          "const iso = (d) => d.toISOString().slice(0, 10);",
          "const plus = (n) => iso(new Date(nowDhaka.getTime() + n * 86400000));",
          "",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"today\", iso(nowDhaka));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"today\", iso(nowDhaka)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"tomorrow\", plus(1));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"tomorrow\", plus(1)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"plus2\", plus(2));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"plus2\", plus(2)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"plus3\", plus(3));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"plus3\", plus(3)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"farFuture\", plus(17));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"farFuture\", plus(17)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"currentMonth\", iso(nowDhaka).slice(0, 7));",
          "try { pm.environment.set(\"currentMonth\", iso(nowDhaka).slice(0, 7)); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
