  "item": [
    {
      "name": "No token → 401",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/messes/{{messId}}/members",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "messes",
            "{{messId}}",
            "members"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Ki proman kore:** Token chhara protected route-e dhoka jay na.\n\n**Ekta chalaki dorkar chilo:** login-e token **cookie-teo** jay, ar Postman cookie ta nijei rekhe dey. Tai shudhu Bearer header sorale-o cookie diye dhuke jeto ar `200` asto.\n\nPre-request script-e cookie jar theke `localhost`-er cookie mucha hoy, tarpor request ta jay — tokhon sotti-i kono credential thake na.\n\n**Erpor-er request gulo** abar login kore ney, tai kichu bhange na.\n\n**Expect:** `401` + `code: \"UNAUTHENTICATED\"`",
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Login-e token cookie-teo bosay. Cookie na mucle ei test mithye pass korto.",
              "// pm.request.url ekhane ekhono \"{{baseUrl}}/...\" — resolve kore nite hobe,",
              "// na hole jar.clear() kono domain-er sathe milbe na.",
              "const base = pm.variables.replaceIn(\"{{baseUrl}}\");",
              "pm.cookies.jar().clear(base, () => {});"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "↪ Login as COOK",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
          "host": [
            "{{baseUrl}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "api",
            "v1",
            "auth",
            "login"
          ]
        },
        "description": "**Role switch.** Niche-r test gulo COOK hisebe chalanor jonno.\n\n**COOK** shudhu aj-kal-er meal count dekhte pare — kono taka-poisar data na.\n\n**Expect:** `200`",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"cook@messmate.test\",\n  \"password\": \"Messmate123\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "auth": {
          "type": "noauth"
        }
      },
      "response": [],
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken);\ntry { pm.environment.set(\"accessToken\", pm.response.json().data.accessToken); } catch (e) { /* no environment selected */ }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
